# WhatsApp Userbot with Gemini AI

A Baileys + Gemini 1.5 Flash WhatsApp userbot.

## Commands

- `.alive` — Returns a stylish "I am alive" message
- `.ai [question]` — Answers using Gemini AI

## Run Locally

```bash
npm install
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env and add your GEMINI_API_KEY
npm start
